CubeRise Privacy Policy

Last Updated: August 3, 2026

1. Introduction

Thank you for choosing CubeRise by Weezard Games. This Privacy Policy explains how information is handled when you use CubeRise. By downloading or playing the game, you agree to this policy.

2. Information We Collect

CubeRise is designed to minimize data collection. The game may store gameplay progress, scores, achievements, settings, and preferences locally on your device. If optional cloud features are introduced in future versions, they will only operate as described in an updated policy.

3. Advertising

CubeRise may display advertisements provided by trusted partners such as Google AdMob. These providers may collect limited device and advertising identifiers to deliver, measure, and improve advertising in accordance with their own privacy policies.

4. Analytics

Anonymous diagnostics and usage information may be collected to understand crashes, improve gameplay balance, enhance performance, and guide future development. This information is not intended to identify you personally.

5. Data Security

We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect information associated with CubeRise. While no system is completely secure, we continually improve our safeguards.

6. Children's Privacy

CubeRise is intended for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information, please contact us so appropriate action can be taken.

7. Future Online Features

Future updates may include optional online services such as cloud saves, leaderboards, events, or achievements. If additional information becomes necessary, this Privacy Policy will be updated before those features are released.

8. Your Choices

You may stop all collection by uninstalling the game. You can also manage personalized advertising through your device settings where supported.

9. Policy Updates

This Privacy Policy may be updated as CubeRise evolves. Material changes will be reflected by updating the revision date.

10. Contact

For questions or privacy requests regarding CubeRise, contact Weezard Games using the support information provided on the official store listing or within the application, where available.

Summary

CubeRise respects player privacy. We collect only the information necessary to operate, improve, and support the game, while striving to provide a secure and enjoyable experience.
